duced gripper_open about 0.787. The can followed vertical lifts and remained stable during mostly pure +y transport. Moved over the basket, descended to eef z=0.178, and opened. Move 50 returned official success=true.\n\n## Feedback\n\nMoves generally returned ok/reached with residuals up to about 1.2 cm. No blocked/contact recovery was needed. Reached feedback alone did not establish a grasp: images and the measured jaw opening revealed the empty close and the later slip.\n\n## Hindsight\n\n世界 +x 朝 agentview 的 BOTTOM，+y 朝 LEFT，+z 向上。真正的 alphabet soup 是初始场景右后方的蓝色圆罐，前面的红绿罐不是目标。腕图与 agentview 横向相反；目标在腕图左侧时通常需要-y靠近。不同深度物体的像素中心不可直接当作相同平面位置：下降时罐盖投影会改变。支撑面的绝对z未直接测得，不能宣称z=0；本集罐侧壁有效抓取的末端高度约0.06，搬运末端高度0.235至0.268，篮上释放高度约0.175至0.178。篮附近成功末端xy约(-0.012,0.232)，这些是实际执行位置而非物体真值。闭合后每次抬升搬运均持续gripper=0；开口约0.64可表示夹住但仍可能滑落，约0.03表示已空。重抓后的约0.788开口更稳定，纯横向搬运比同时多轴快速改变更可靠。罐直径视觉约5至6厘米，开爪可跨两侧。先确认物体身份可节省大量预算。\nEOF","timeout":200}}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":348,"output":740,"cacheRead":89728,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":90816,"cost":{"input":0.000696,"output":0.0074,"cacheRead":0.008972800000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017068800000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792485003893,"responseId":"resp_0a5a7deec9b26cbb016ad726947b0087d0aee666cd22b02461","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":33802,"thinkingLevel":"high"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ep6nNAify3mRsTwLqsCmzbYd|fc_0a5a7deec9b26cbb016ad72698157887d09bef835ab4e3aa86","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"(no output)"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":10,"timestamp":1792485037706},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0a5a7deec9b26cbb016ad726bd03a087d0a6d41f4545763669\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":974,"output":4,"cacheRead":89856,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":90834,"cost":{"input